#, python-format
msgid "Postulo is checked against WCAG 2.2 at level AA, in both themes, at 320 pixels and under Windows High Contrast; reduced motion and more contrast follow your system's own setting. What is checked, what is known not to work yet, and how to tell us when something does not work for you is on the <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">Accessibility page<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>."
msgstr "Postulo se provjerava prema WCAG 2.2 na nivou AA, u obje teme, na 320 piksela i pod Windows visokim kontrastom; smanjeno kretanje i veći kontrast prate postavku vašeg sistema. Šta se provjerava, šta je poznato da još ne radi i kako nam javiti kad vam nešto ne radi nalazi se na <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">stranici Pristupačnost<span class=\"sr-only\"> (otvara se u novoj kartici)</span></a>."

